{title: 065 - God Be With You}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #065 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 65}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]God be with you till we meet [F]a[Bb]gain; [Eb]By His counsels guide, uphold [Bb]you,
[F]With His sheep se[F7]curely [Bb]fold you: God be [Eb]with you [Bb]till we meet [F]a[Bb]gain.
[Bb]Till we meet, till we [Eb]meet, Till we [Bb]meet at Jesus' [F]feet,
[F]Till we [Bb]meet, till we [Eb]meet God be [Bb]with you till we meet [F]a[Bb]gain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Bb]Till [F]we [Bb]meet, [Eb]till [Bb]we meet,
[F][F7]Till [Bb]we [Eb]meet [Bb]at [F]Jesus' [Bb]feet;
[Bb]Till [Eb]we meet, [Bb]till [F]we meet,
[F]God [Bb]be [Eb]with you [Bb]till [F]we [Bb]meet again.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]God [F]be with [Bb]you [Eb]till we [Bb]meet again;
[F][F7]'Neath [Bb]His [Eb]wings [Bb]securely [F]hide [Bb]you;
[Bb]Daily [Eb]manna [Bb]still [F]provide you;
[F]God [Bb]be [Eb]with you [Bb]till [F]we [Bb]meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Bb]God [F]be with [Bb]you [Eb]till we [Bb]meet again;
[F][F7]When [Bb]life's [Eb]perils [Bb]thick [F]confound [Bb]you;
[Bb]Put [Eb]His arms [Bb]unfailing [F]round you;
[F]God [Bb]be [Eb]with you [Bb]till [F]we [Bb]meet again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Bb]God [F]be with [Bb]you [Eb]till we [Bb]meet again;
[F][F7]Keep [Bb]love's [Eb]banner [Bb]floating [F]over [Bb]you,
[Bb]Strike [Eb]death's threatening [Bb]wave [F]before you;
[F]God [Bb]be [Eb]with you [Bb]till [F]we [Bb]meet again.
{end_of_verse}
